@FlightTracker.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5158

### Check that the API is running
GET {{FlightTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### Planes seen in the last 2 minutes, with their latest position
GET {{FlightTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/api/planes/live
Accept: application/json

### Closest planes to home (limit is 1 to 50, default 5)
GET {{FlightTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/api/planes/overhead?limit=5
Accept: application/json

### Recent positions of live planes, for trails (minutes is 1 to 30, default 5)
GET {{FlightTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/api/planes/trails?minutes=5
Accept: application/json

### Path for one plane over the last 24 hours (hours is 1 to 720, default 24)
GET {{FlightTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/api/planes/c07c7b/history?hours=24
Accept: application/json

### Stats for today
GET {{FlightTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/api/stats
Accept: application/json

### Bad input: should return 400
GET {{FlightTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/api/planes/not-a-hex/history
Accept: application/json

### Bad input: should return 400
GET {{FlightTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/api/planes/overhead?limit=500
Accept: application/json

###
